{"seq":25,"slug":"market-design-mechanism-design","title":"市场设计与机制设计","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"市场设计与机制设计\">市场设计与机制设计</h1><p>经济学大多数分支研究的是「给定规则，人会怎么做」。机制设计反过来问：「我想要某个结果，应该设计什么规则，才能让自利的人在追求自身利益时恰好把这个结果实现出来？」这就是 Leonid Hurwicz 所说的「逆向博弈论」——博弈论分析既有游戏的均衡，机制设计则把均衡当作目标，去倒推那张能产生它的规则表。市场设计是这门理论落地的工程学：当被设计的对象是一个真实的市场——拍卖频谱、给学生分学校、给病人配肾源——理论必须直面参与者会撒谎、会算计、会钻空子的现实。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 沿着「从抽象到具体、从理论到工程」的四级阶梯展开。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础与机制设计理论」奠定全 hub 的概念地基。它讲清楚机制设计为什么是逆向博弈论，引入贯穿始终的两块基石：激励相容（让说真话成为最优策略）与显示原理（任何机制能实现的，一个「让大家直接报真话」的直接机制也能实现，于是设计空间大幅收窄）。这一章也划出理论的边界——Gibbard-Satterthwaite 与 Arrow 告诉我们什么做不到，VCG 与 Myerson-Satterthwaite 告诉我们在什么代价下能做到什么。</p>\n<p>第二章「拍卖理论」把机制设计应用到最经典的单边市场：一个卖家、多个买家、用价格分配。从四种基本拍卖形式与令人惊讶的收入等价定理出发，到 Myerson 的最优拍卖（卖家如何设计保留价与虚拟价值来榨取收入），再到买家估值相互关联时的共同价值与赢者诅咒，最后落到一次卖多件、物品间有互补与替代关系的组合拍卖与频谱拍卖——后者是机制设计史上最著名的工程实践。</p>\n<p>第三章「匹配市场」转向另一类截然不同的市场：价格不能（或不该）出清的双边市场。学生不能向学校出价、病人不能向捐肾者付钱，于是分配必须靠匹配算法而非价格。这一章以 Gale-Shapley 的延迟接受算法和稳定性概念为核心，讲它如何重塑医生住院医匹配、纽约与波士顿的学校选择，以及 Roth 等人如何用顶层交易循环把它推广到肾脏交换这一「拯救生命的市场设计」。</p>\n<p>第四章「前沿与应用」把镜头拉到 2025–2026 年的计算与 AI 前沿：每天运行数十亿次的数字广告拍卖、用复杂度与近似比重新审视机制设计的算法机制设计、以及公平分配、加密货币的交易费机制与 AI 智能体之间正在形成的新市场。这一章展示理论如何被规模、速度和对抗性博弈重新逼问。</p>\n<p>四章之间不是并列而是递进：第一章的显示原理是第二、三章一切设计的许可证；拍卖的「用价格分配」与匹配的「无价格分配」是机制设计的两翼；前沿章则把前三章的工具放进算力与算法的熔炉里重铸。建议初学者顺序通读，已有基础者可从任一章的引言切入再按交叉链接跳转。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与机制设计理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"从博弈论到机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/foundations/intro-and-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"incentive-compatibility-revelation","title":"激励相容与显示原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/foundations/incentive-compatibility-revelation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"impossibility-possibility-theorems","title":"不可能性与可能性定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/foundations/impossibility-possibility-theorems"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"auction-theory","title":"拍卖理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/auction-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"auction-formats-revenue-equivalence","title":"拍卖形式与收入等价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/auction-theory/auction-formats-revenue-equivalence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimal-auctions-common-values","title":"最优拍卖与共同价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/auction-theory/optimal-auctions-common-values"},{"seq":3,"slug":"combinatorial-spectrum-auctions","title":"组合拍卖与频谱拍卖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/auction-theory/combinatorial-spectrum-auctions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"matching-markets","title":"匹配市场","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/matching-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stable-matching-deferred-acceptance","title":"稳定匹配与延迟接受","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/matching-markets/stable-matching-deferred-acceptance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"school-choice-assignment","title":"学校选择与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/matching-markets/school-choice-assignment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kidney-exchange-top-trading-cycles","title":"肾脏交换与顶层交易循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/matching-markets/kidney-exchange-top-trading-cycles"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers-applications","title":"前沿与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/frontiers-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-platform-ad-auctions","title":"数字平台与广告拍卖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/frontiers-applications/digital-platform-ad-auctions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithmic-mechanism-design","title":"算法机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/frontiers-applications/algorithmic-mechanism-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fairness-crypto-ai-markets","title":"公平分配、加密与AI市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/market-design-mechanism-design/frontiers-applications/fairness-crypto-ai-markets"}]}]}